# మాలిని · malini — prosodic grammar (vrutta, 4 lines, 15 aksharas per line)
# generated from meter_rules.yaml by indic_meter_dawg; do not edit by hand
#
# One grammar, three forms: (1) hierarchical, for reading; (2) right-linear, the same language flattened;
# (3) strict, one symbol per production = the prosodic automaton. All three generate exactly the same poems.
#
# Terminals: U = guru (2 matras), I = laghu (1 matra), ⏎ = line separator.
# Nonterminals: Poem, Unit, Line_<slot>, gana classes (Surya, Indra, Kanda, M4 …), ganas (భ, ర, …).
#   Kanda−జ  = the class minus జ (a constraint removed it)   Kanda=జ|నల = only జ or నల allowed
#   Kanda$U  = only members ending in a guru                   X⟨U⟩ = inside the branch where every line starts with U
#   L2.G3    = line 2, about to read gana 3 (forms 2 and 3)
#   A_UUI_2  = inside alternative UUI of A, 2 symbols already read (form 3 only)

# ===== 1. Hierarchical: Poem → lines → gana classes → ganas → symbols
# poem
Poem → Line ⏎ Line ⏎ Line ⏎ Line                 # 4 lines

# lines
Line → న న మ య య                                 # slot all: 5 ganas

# ganas → symbols
న → I I I                                        # na, 3 matras
మ → U U U                                        # ma, 6 matras
య → I U U                                        # ya, 5 matras

# ===== 2. Right-linear (A → wB | w) over {U, I, ⏎}: the hierarchy flattened
Poem → III L1.G2
L1.G2 → III L1.G3
L1.G3 → UUU L1.G4
L1.G4 → IUU L1.G5
L1.G5 → IUU⏎ L2.G1
L2.G1 → III L2.G2
L2.G2 → III L2.G3
L2.G3 → UUU L2.G4
L2.G4 → IUU L2.G5
L2.G5 → IUU⏎ L3.G1
L3.G1 → III L3.G2
L3.G2 → III L3.G3
L3.G3 → UUU L3.G4
L3.G4 → IUU L3.G5
L3.G5 → IUU⏎ L4.G1
L4.G1 → III L4.G2
L4.G2 → III L4.G3
L4.G3 → UUU L4.G4
L4.G4 → IUU L4.G5
L4.G5 → IUU

# ===== 3. Strict (A → aB | a): 63 productions, 64 states;
# minimized prosodic automaton: 64 states. Every production is commented.
Poem → I Poem_III_1               # న na: symbol 1/3 read, 2 to go
Poem_III_1 → I Poem_III_2         # న na: symbol 2/3 read, 1 to go
Poem_III_2 → I L1.G2              # న na: symbol 3/3, complete → L1.G2
L1.G2 → I L1.G2_III_1             # న na: symbol 1/3 read, 2 to go
L1.G2_III_1 → I L1.G2_III_2       # న na: symbol 2/3 read, 1 to go
L1.G2_III_2 → I L1.G3             # న na: symbol 3/3, complete → L1.G3
L1.G3 → U L1.G3_UUU_1             # మ ma: symbol 1/3 read, 2 to go
L1.G3_UUU_1 → U L1.G3_UUU_2       # మ ma: symbol 2/3 read, 1 to go
L1.G3_UUU_2 → U L1.G4             # మ ma: symbol 3/3, complete → L1.G4
L1.G4 → I L1.G4_IUU_1             # య ya: symbol 1/3 read, 2 to go
L1.G4_IUU_1 → U L1.G4_IUU_2       # య ya: symbol 2/3 read, 1 to go
L1.G4_IUU_2 → U L1.G5             # య ya: symbol 3/3, complete → L1.G5
L1.G5 → I L1.G5_IUUNL_1           # య ya: symbol 1/4 read, 3 to go
L1.G5_IUUNL_1 → U L1.G5_IUUNL_2   # య ya: symbol 2/4 read, 2 to go
L1.G5_IUUNL_2 → U L1.G5_IUUNL_3   # య ya: symbol 3/4 read, 1 to go
L1.G5_IUUNL_3 → ⏎ L2.G1           # య ya: symbol 4/4, complete → L2.G1
L2.G1 → I L2.G1_III_1             # న na: symbol 1/3 read, 2 to go
L2.G1_III_1 → I L2.G1_III_2       # న na: symbol 2/3 read, 1 to go
L2.G1_III_2 → I L2.G2             # న na: symbol 3/3, complete → L2.G2
L2.G2 → I L2.G2_III_1             # న na: symbol 1/3 read, 2 to go
L2.G2_III_1 → I L2.G2_III_2       # న na: symbol 2/3 read, 1 to go
L2.G2_III_2 → I L2.G3             # న na: symbol 3/3, complete → L2.G3
L2.G3 → U L2.G3_UUU_1             # మ ma: symbol 1/3 read, 2 to go
L2.G3_UUU_1 → U L2.G3_UUU_2       # మ ma: symbol 2/3 read, 1 to go
L2.G3_UUU_2 → U L2.G4             # మ ma: symbol 3/3, complete → L2.G4
L2.G4 → I L2.G4_IUU_1             # య ya: symbol 1/3 read, 2 to go
L2.G4_IUU_1 → U L2.G4_IUU_2       # య ya: symbol 2/3 read, 1 to go
L2.G4_IUU_2 → U L2.G5             # య ya: symbol 3/3, complete → L2.G5
L2.G5 → I L2.G5_IUUNL_1           # య ya: symbol 1/4 read, 3 to go
L2.G5_IUUNL_1 → U L2.G5_IUUNL_2   # య ya: symbol 2/4 read, 2 to go
L2.G5_IUUNL_2 → U L2.G5_IUUNL_3   # య ya: symbol 3/4 read, 1 to go
L2.G5_IUUNL_3 → ⏎ L3.G1           # య ya: symbol 4/4, complete → L3.G1
L3.G1 → I L3.G1_III_1             # న na: symbol 1/3 read, 2 to go
L3.G1_III_1 → I L3.G1_III_2       # న na: symbol 2/3 read, 1 to go
L3.G1_III_2 → I L3.G2             # న na: symbol 3/3, complete → L3.G2
L3.G2 → I L3.G2_III_1             # న na: symbol 1/3 read, 2 to go
L3.G2_III_1 → I L3.G2_III_2       # న na: symbol 2/3 read, 1 to go
L3.G2_III_2 → I L3.G3             # న na: symbol 3/3, complete → L3.G3
L3.G3 → U L3.G3_UUU_1             # మ ma: symbol 1/3 read, 2 to go
L3.G3_UUU_1 → U L3.G3_UUU_2       # మ ma: symbol 2/3 read, 1 to go
L3.G3_UUU_2 → U L3.G4             # మ ma: symbol 3/3, complete → L3.G4
L3.G4 → I L3.G4_IUU_1             # య ya: symbol 1/3 read, 2 to go
L3.G4_IUU_1 → U L3.G4_IUU_2       # య ya: symbol 2/3 read, 1 to go
L3.G4_IUU_2 → U L3.G5             # య ya: symbol 3/3, complete → L3.G5
L3.G5 → I L3.G5_IUUNL_1           # య ya: symbol 1/4 read, 3 to go
L3.G5_IUUNL_1 → U L3.G5_IUUNL_2   # య ya: symbol 2/4 read, 2 to go
L3.G5_IUUNL_2 → U L3.G5_IUUNL_3   # య ya: symbol 3/4 read, 1 to go
L3.G5_IUUNL_3 → ⏎ L4.G1           # య ya: symbol 4/4, complete → L4.G1
L4.G1 → I L4.G1_III_1             # న na: symbol 1/3 read, 2 to go
L4.G1_III_1 → I L4.G1_III_2       # న na: symbol 2/3 read, 1 to go
L4.G1_III_2 → I L4.G2             # న na: symbol 3/3, complete → L4.G2
L4.G2 → I L4.G2_III_1             # న na: symbol 1/3 read, 2 to go
L4.G2_III_1 → I L4.G2_III_2       # న na: symbol 2/3 read, 1 to go
L4.G2_III_2 → I L4.G3             # న na: symbol 3/3, complete → L4.G3
L4.G3 → U L4.G3_UUU_1             # మ ma: symbol 1/3 read, 2 to go
L4.G3_UUU_1 → U L4.G3_UUU_2       # మ ma: symbol 2/3 read, 1 to go
L4.G3_UUU_2 → U L4.G4             # మ ma: symbol 3/3, complete → L4.G4
L4.G4 → I L4.G4_IUU_1             # య ya: symbol 1/3 read, 2 to go
L4.G4_IUU_1 → U L4.G4_IUU_2       # య ya: symbol 2/3 read, 1 to go
L4.G4_IUU_2 → U L4.G5             # య ya: symbol 3/3, complete → L4.G5
L4.G5 → I L4.G5_IUU_1             # య ya: symbol 1/3 read, 2 to go
L4.G5_IUU_1 → U L4.G5_IUU_2       # య ya: symbol 2/3 read, 1 to go
L4.G5_IUU_2 → U                   # య ya: symbol 3/3, complete, line ends
